# Project Registers

In Minimal, this file may own individual items. In Standard and High-Assurance,
`../machine-readable/raidq.json` owns item records and this file owns
vocabulary, review method, and summary.

Track risks, assumptions, issues, dependencies, and open questions with stable
IDs, owners, review dates, and resolution conditions.

No project-specific register item has been recorded.

Material decision questions are not duplicated here. Route them to
`.agent/decisions/governance-register.json`; link a RAIDQ item to its
`DREG-####` decision question when resolution requires an owner choice.
